@description TotalReaper
@author Frank Acklin
@version 0.2.3
@changelog
  Added: Only Set Main Submix, an option in the settings window that narrows TotalReaper to the master track's hardware bus. The other hardware outputs are then left alone in both directions. Nothing is written to them, so a cue mix you built by hand in TotalMix survives, including switching the routing mirror off, which otherwise pulls every routing it ever wrote down to minus infinity. And nothing TotalMix reports on them is read back, so a separate headphone mixer driving those submixes on the interface does not rewrite REAPER's send levels behind you. Switch the option off and the other buses are pushed again on the next tick.
@provides
